{"subject":"New Position: JC1342 Senior Director Clinical Quality and Infection Prevention","from":"Filippa Etherton <Filippa.Etherton@tidalhealth.org>","received":"2026-07-21T20:34:52Z","category":"New Position","id":"AAMkADk1MWNmNjlkLWUwNDMtNDA1YS1hNWE1LWM4NjcyZWNmMjI3MgBGAAAAAACVY1g7tYBDQrblouFwBAEZBwBuBgY699yeSZ3FxYmVftSLAAAAAAEMAABuBgY699yeSZ3FxYmVftSLAABM5No6AAA=","imid":"<CY2PR01MB335798AD70B3552E796AA9C1AD98C22@CY2PR01MB335798.prod.exchangelabs.com>","body":"<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered medium)\"><style>\r\n<!--\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Wingdings}\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:\"Cambria Math\"}\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Calibri}\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:Aptos}\r\n@font-face\r\n\t{font-family:\"Segoe Script\"}\r\np.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\r\n\t{margin:0in;\r\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\r\n\tfont-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif}\r\np.MsoListParagraph, li.MsoListParagraph, div.MsoListParagraph\r\n\t{margin-top:0in;\r\n\tmargin-right:0in;\r\n\tmargin-bottom:0in;\r\n\tmargin-left:.5in;\r\n\tfont-size:11.0pt;\r\n\tfont-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif}\r\nspan.EmailStyle17\r\n\t{font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\r\n\tcolor:windowtext}\r\n.MsoChpDefault\r\n\t{}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n\t{margin:1.0in 1.0in 1.0in 1.0in}\r\ndiv.WordSection1\r\n\t{}\r\nol\r\n\t{margin-bottom:0in}\r\nul\r\n\t{margin-bottom:0in}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#467886\" vlink=\"#96607D\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Hello team!</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">A new position has been created and approved to be filled. Please see position info below. <a id=\"OWAAMC3A1A9BBAA0D4D9BA0524AA489071B8C\" href=\"mailto:Trudy.Hall@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Trudy Hall</span></a> there are any more changes to the position description information listed below, please let us know so we can adjust.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Reason:</span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Upgrade to existing filled FTE (Susan Elerding)</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a id=\"OWAAMB8BF680DA2354C209EBEB5C88813725C\" href=\"mailto:Nikki.Merchant@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Nikki Merchant</span></a> Demi has approved for this position to be filled without posting; however please issue an offer letter to Susan, the desired effective date is 8/09/2026. Susan’s new base salary will be $170,500.00 plus a 15% variable compensation target.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a id=\"OWAAM625ED1BCCA694E389BD00737C6CD5347\" href=\"mailto:Trudy.Hall@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Trudy Hall</span></a> please issue <b>a status change PAM</b> transitioning Susan to JC1342 effective 8/09/2026.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Please let us know if there are any additional questions, we are happy to help.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Title: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Senior Director Clinical Quality and Infection Prevention</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">PL/CC/JC</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">11/7000/1342</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:16.55pt\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Grade: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">90</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Salary Range:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">$136,827.59-$198,400 + eligible for 15% variable comp</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">FLSA: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Exempt (salaried)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">FTE Leader:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Y</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Direct Supervision: </span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Director of Quality and Safety MP, Clinical Data Abstractor, Clinical Data Analyst, Clinical Quality Analyst, Infection Prevention staff, Med Staff Specialist, and Quality Improvement Specialists</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">FTE Hours:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">1.00</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Reports to:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Vice President Medical Affairs/CMO</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Job Description Status:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">In progress, information for position template is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Position Summary:</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">The Senior Director of Clinical Quality &amp; Infection Prevention oversees quality management activities at the system-level, including peer review, performance improvement, and infection prevention. They develop strategic plans, policies, budgeting activities, and ensure compliance with regulatory agencies. Responsibilities include conducting medical staff clinical peer reviews, managing data related to quality variances, and directing organizational quality measures. The Senior Director also acts as a lead change agent, influencing physician performance and facilitating quality initiatives for the TidalHealth and Medical Partners system. They maintain confidentiality of peer review information and report quality improvement activities to various stakeholders. Additionally, they have direct oversight for the infection prevention program across the system, develop goals, action plans, and ensure compliance with standards and regulations.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Education:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Master’s degree in Nursing (MSN) or related health field is required.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">License and/or certification::</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Licensed as a Registered Nurse (RN) in the state of residency is required.</span><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></b></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Certified Professional in Healthcare Quality (CPHQ) required.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Lean/Six Sigma Green Belt certification or equivalent training is required. Lean/Six Sigma Black Belt certification preferred.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Experience:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Minimum of seven (7) years of clinical experience required.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; text-indent:-.25in; line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Minimum of five (5) years of management experience required.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; text-indent:-.25in; line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Experience with organizational QA processes is strongly preferred.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; text-indent:-.25in; line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Proficient in Windows-based operating software and systems that include MS Word, MS Excel, MS Access and MS PowerPoint.</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Schedule:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Evenings and weekends may be required as needed.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Trudy/Kristin</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">- for any reporting structure changes, please submit a status change PAM indicating any of those reporting changes. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">Filippa Etherton, SHRM-SCP<br></span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">Compensation Manager<br>Human Resources<br><b>TidalHealth<br>O </b>410-912-6744<br>mytidalhealth.org</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">Have a question for HR? Submit a ticket to Shared Services;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe Script&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\"><a href=\"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8/a/7f4b8c55-c804-4afa-93c3-f7308ddcbdae?tenantId=ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8&amp;hint=384e5157-8ea1-4b5c-912b-4a3979a7f5f3&amp;source=sharebutton&amp;sourcetime=1769439969989\">HR Questions &amp; Answers</a></span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}